Hi <%= @client.name %>,

Please find attached invoice <%= @invoice.invoice_number %> for <%= Money.from_amount(@invoice.total, @invoice.currency).format %>, due on <%= @invoice.due_date&.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>.

Invoice:    <%= @invoice.invoice_number %>
Issue date: <%= @invoice.issue_date&.strftime("%b %-d, %Y") %>
Due date:   <%= @invoice.due_date&.strftime("%b %-d, %Y") %>
Amount due: <%= Money.from_amount(@invoice.balance_due, @invoice.currency).format %>

View & pay online: <%= @pay_url %>

<% if @user.bank_details.present? -%>
Payment details:
<%= @user.bank_details %>
<% end -%>

Thank you for your business!
<%= @user.display_name %>
